From: Christopher Albert <albert@tugraz.at>
Date: Wed, 22 Apr 2026 12:36:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] testsuite: Add reporter attribution to fork-only
 finalize_constructor_1.f90 [PR fortran/121472]

Fork-only testcase on branch pr121472-constructor-finalizer-ice, never
submitted to upstream or uploaded to Bugzilla (the four PR121472
patches attached to the Bugzilla bug do not include this file).
Retrospective attribution header added as part of a manual Bugzilla-
provenance audit on 2026-04-22 (meta-repo tracking commit 40f0a94;
GitHub issues on krystophny/gcc-dev).  The test was derived from
Andrew Benson's Bugzilla Comment #0 reproducer; adding the credit now
so the chain of custody is in place before any future upstream
submission.  No behavioural change.

Assisted-by: Claude (Anthropic)
Assisted-by: GPT (OpenAI)

	PR fortran/121472

gcc/testsuite/ChangeLog:

	* gfortran.dg/finalize_constructor_1.f90: Add reporter attribution
	header.

Signed-off-by: Christopher Albert <albert@tugraz.at>
---
 gcc/testsuite/gfortran.dg/finalize_constructor_1.f90 | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/gcc/testsuite/gfortran.dg/finalize_constructor_1.f90 b/gcc/testsuite/gfortran.dg/finalize_constructor_1.f90
index ea95d0707a2..3064bcd123c 100644
--- a/gcc/testsuite/gfortran.dg/finalize_constructor_1.f90
+++ b/gcc/testsuite/gfortran.dg/finalize_constructor_1.f90
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 ! { dg-output " constructor: *1(\n|\r\n|\r)" }
 ! { dg-output " finalizer: *2(\n|\r\n|\r)" }
 ! PR fortran/121472
+! Contributed by Andrew Benson  <abensonca@gcc.gnu.org>
 ! Test that derived types with finalizers and constructor interfaces compile
 ! without ICE and produce ISO F2018 compliant finalization behavior.
 !
